{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,0],[1000013,0],[1000014,0],[1000015,-1],[1000016,0],[1000017,400],[1000018,0],[1000019,0],[1000020,4],[1000021,99000005],[1000022,4],[1000023,99000006],[1000024,50],[1000025,50],[1000026,50000],[1000027,4],[1000028,99000017],[1000029,3],[1000030,40000000],[1000031,0],[1000032,0],[1000033,1],[1000034,2],[1000035,3],[1000036,4],[1000037,5],[1000038,6],[1000039,7],[1000040,8],[1000041,9],[1000042,10],[1000043,11],[1000044,12],[1000045,13],[1000046,14],[1000047,15],[1000048,34],[1000049,35],[1000050,36],[1000051,77],[1000052,78],[1000053,33],[1000054,27],[1000055,28],[1000056,38],[1000057,39],[1000058,3],[1000059,25],[1000060,26],[1000061,30],[1000062,37],[1000063,10],[1000064,40],[1000065,41],[1000066,42],[1000067,43],[1000068,53],[1000069,80],[1000070,51],[1000071,24],[1000072,64]],"messages":{"1000000":"Town of Antalusia\n","1000001":"Town of Antalusia\n","1000002":"I am Berini, Bishop of the Noil religious sect.\nI don't think I've seen you here before.\n","1000003":"What?\nYou have a letter from Rector Morris?\n","1000004":"Let me see...\n","1000005":"...\n","1000006":"All right, I understand the situation.\nNo one should be training in the tower.\n","1000007":"If you bring a notice from me,\nthere shouldn't be any problems.\n","1000008":"I'll leave this matter to you.\n","1000009":"I'll leave this matter to you.\n","1000010":"The Sacred Wing, a\nsacred relic of Altecia!\n","1000011":"Thank you for recapturing it.\nI'll give you a reward for it!\n","1000012":"Since you're a hired warrior, I suppose something substantial\nwould be better than an honorary award.\n","1000013":"...\n","1000014":"Hmm... well...\n","1000015":"How about the right to use the Giant Warehouse III\nin the Tower of Ordeal at Cold Svalt? OK?\n","1000016":"May Altecia bless you!\n","1000017":"Demons have been trying to steal the sacred relics of Altecia.\nThese crazy things are happening everywhere.\n","1000018":"Thefts have happened in the past but strange things\nare taking place more and more...\n","1000019":"As soon as we found out that another sacred relic is located in an underground\ncave below of one of our churches, demons started occupying the cave.\n","1000020":"Their timing is too good.\n","1000021":"You've returned the Sacred Wing, so now you have our trust.\nWe would to ask one more thing of you...\n","1000022":"Can you get rid of all the demons in the underground cave\nand return the sacred Angel's Hair relic?\n","1000023":"You can enter the underground cave from the back of this church.\n","1000024":"You're a brave one,\nmighty Dragon slayer.\n","1000025":"I'll leave it to you.\n","1000026":"I'll leave it to you.\n","1000027":"That's it! That's the sacred relic of Altecia.\nWe really owe you!.\n","1000028":"To show our appreciation for the job, I'll give you the ability\nto use one of our ancient, secret incantations.\n","1000029":"~    Hell Fire   ~  Causes a fire explosion.\n~   Ice Blast    ~  Creates ice pillars around you.\n~      Heal      ~  Restores your physical strength.\n~  Earth Spears  ~  Attack the enemy with an earth spear.\n~  Sonic Blade   ~  Cast shock waves.\n \n~ Need Experience Value ~  50%\n","1000030":"You seem to know that spell already.\n","1000031":"From now on, use this power to ensure the protection of the world.\n","1000032":"From now on, use this power to ensure the protection of the world.\n","1000033":"I have every confidence in you\nbecause you had the ability to return the two sacred relics.\n","1000034":"From now on, we'll hire you whenever there is a job.\nDon't worry. The army is okay with this.\n","1000035":"Now I want to tell you something\nthat only a few of the Noils know about. Please keep it a secret.\n","1000036":"The Noil religious sect worships the White Angel Altecia,\nand we believe her sacred relics are a key towards\nregaining the magical abilities and powers of the Ancient World.\n","1000037":"A long time ago,\nthe power of the Ancient World was abused, and it polluted the world.\n","1000038":"The eastern area was the worst. The area was destroyed\nand people couldn't live there without an air purification system.\n","1000039":"If the powers of the Ancient World fall into the wrong hands,\nour world will fall. This world is weakened and our current abilities\naren't strong enough to protect us.\n","1000040":"To avoid the situation, the Noils of the past hid\nsacred relics of Altecia and spread them all throughout the world.\nNow the Noils need to reseal the sacred relics of Altecia.\n","1000041":"Some of our sealing facilities, including the Dragon Seal\nat the mining tunnel of Yugunos and the Tower of Ordeal, were used\nto protect the ancient beings. Well, some people are for using them,\nbut others are against it. Anyways...\n","1000042":"About the thefts of the sacred relics lately...\n","1000043":"The last robbery occurred in the underground cave of our church.\nThe timing was just too good. It occurred just as we found out about\nthe hidden relic. We've concluded that there is a high probability\nof a traitor amongst the Noils.\n","1000044":"Under these circumstances, we wanted to have a person unknown to the\nNoils investigate the situation. That's why we asked for your help.\n","1000045":"Could you go to our fort in Losmans,\nand take this report to Cardinal Barshival?\n","1000046":"Losmans is far west of here.\nAfter passing through this town and Gungustonwald, keep going west.\nIt is a long way, but you can make it.\n","1000047":"The destiny of our world may be on your shoulders.\nDon't give up.\n","1000048":"What?\nYou cannot enter Losmans because the castle wall is being repaired?\n","1000049":"The castle wall in Losmans is energized by light powers of the\nAncient World. I've heard that the power was getting weak\nbecause of the last big attack.\n","1000050":"General Gronholm, who lives in this town,\nmight be able to give you some information about Losmans.\n","1000051":"Could you talk with him?\n","1000052":"Thank you.\n","1000053":"So do you want to buy something or not?\n \n \u30fb~Buy Armaments         ~\n \u30fb~Buy Equipment         ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                                 ~QUIT~\n","1000054":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000055":"You don't have enough money.\n","1000056":"Everything seems fine.\n","1000057":"To identify your item, it costs %d in Gold.  OK?\n \n                                  ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000058":"You have no unidentified items.\n","1000059":"My name is Kes.\nWe have things here\nthat you can't find in the east.\n","1000060":"How about some Attribute Medicine?\nWith this medicine, you can freely change your attributes.\n","1000061":"How do you restore your former attributes?\nJust take the White Medicine.\nIt's a bit expensive though.\n","1000062":"Remember that you can only take one of each Attribute Medicine.\nYou can't give the medicine to anyone else\nbecause it is dangerous if somebody misuses it.\n","1000063":"After you buy it,\nchoose SPECIAL ITEM from the ITEM screen,\nor press X to open the SPECIAL ITEM screen.\n","1000064":"What are you waiting for?\n","1000065":"My name is Talia.\nI'm a holy spirit witch and a former dancer.\n","1000066":"Did you know that holy spirit witches\nhave to be good dancers?\n","1000067":"See? I'm good, right?\n","1000068":"I can heal you with my dancing.\nLook!\n","1000069":"Only the injured\nare allowed to see my dancing.\n","1000070":"...\n","1000071":"You're the hired warrior that Bishop Berini mentioned.\nI'm General Gronholm,\nin charge of security around Antalusia.\n","1000072":"You're talking about the castle wall in Losmans.\n","1000073":"The last attack reduced the power of the wall drastically.\nDuring repairs, they haven't been letting anyone enter the town\nbecause of the unstable condition of the facility.\n","1000074":"The army has a plan to supply energy\nfrom another facility to restore the power of the wall\nbut...\n","1000075":"the facility has been captured by demons,\nand that's trouble.\n","1000076":"The facility is located in the Remains of Heartbeat in the Wilds of\nRyumyaku. It's north of West Antalusia and east of the Plain of\nDialose. Can you head to the remains\nand try and recapture the facility from them?\n","1000077":"Thanks for your help.\nDo your best.\n","1000078":"You succeeded in recapturing the Remains of Heartbeat.\n","1000079":"Thanks for a job well done.\nYou're a very knowledgeable warrior.\n","1000080":"I wish I could say that castle wall is OK now,\nbut the situation has become more complicated\naccording to our reports.\n","1000081":"The Remains of Heartbeat is an energy facility that has been\ninactive. Somebody seems to occupying the plumbing facility\nthat sends energy from the Remains of Heartbeat to Losmans.\n","1000082":"It sounds like the demons worship\nthe plumbing facility.\n","1000083":"Don't you think it's curious that\ndemons have been popping up in all the right places lately?\n","1000084":"I want you check out the plumbing facility.\nThe facility is by the Gulf of Lucentia,\nwest of Plain of Dialose and\nnorth of West Antalusia.\nIt is south of the town of Calado.\n","1000085":"Your skills exceed\nthat of most hired warriors.\nKeep going.\n","1000086":"Keep going.\n","1000087":"Thank you.\nPlease accept this as a reward.\n","1000088":"Reports say that repairs on the castle wall in Losmans are finished.\nA big attack, like the last attack, should not happen again any time soon.\nWe'll be OK for the moment.\n","1000089":"You will head for Losmans.\nThe area west of Losmans is dangerous\nso watch out.\n","1000090":"Demons living in the west are more ferocious than those in the east\nbecause Hiperion is nearby. Don't overestimate your abilities\nand be prepared for the creatures there.\n","1000091":"When will we have peace?\n","1000092":"You know what?\nSomebody said that the Tears of Oberon, the gems of\nthe Holy Spirit King, have been stolen!\n","1000093":"You know what?\nI heard there is a hired warrior\nthat is retrieving the Tears of Oberon,\nthe gem of the Holy Sprit King of the Elves!\n","1000094":"What? What can I do for you?\n","1000095":"Somebody said that\nthere is an apple tree in South Antalusia.\n","1000096":"I don't eat apples.\n","1000097":"Blast! Because of the demons in this area,\nI can't head outside and pick fruit.\n","1000098":"I'll tell you something.\n","1000099":"There are green apple trees\nin the Plain of Dialose.\n","1000100":"I can't go outside of town\nbecause of the demons.\n","1000101":"Oh, I've heard that...\n","1000102":"There is a merchant\nwho sells meat at Gore Cave in Gungustonwald.\n","1000103":"Um, what?\n","1000104":"I remember that a fruit\nmy grandpa got from Gungustonwald\nwas yummy.\n","1000105":"It was Akebi fruit, right?\n","1000106":"Mmm...\n","1000107":"If I had some Vitality Sauce,\nmmm...\n","1000108":"What the..!?\n","1000109":"Is... Is that Vitality Sauce!?\nWhere did you get that?\n","1000110":"Listen, can you give it to me?\nI'll give you something rare instead.\n","1000111":"Northwest of this town is the town of Calado,\nto the west is Losmans,\nand to the southwest is Ponse, the Village of Dwarves.\n","1000112":"Who are you?\n","1000113":"Ha hah hah...\n","1000114":"If you give me 80,000 in gold, I'll tell you something.\nWhat do you say?\n           ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000115":"You are a warrior.\n","1000116":"Hah ha ha... You're something special.\n","1000117":"Hop on a Warp Rune to transport.\n","1000118":"Hang in there.\n","1000119":"Not enough money.\n","1000120":"Yesiree!\nI've got mighty good things.\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,2],[0,3,10000001,3],[0,3,10000002,4],[0,3,10000003,6],[0,5,4294967295,8],[0,0,12000000,12],[0,1,12000000,26],[0,0,12000001,58],[0,1,12000001,61],[0,0,12000002,123],[0,1,12000002,131],[0,0,12000003,138],[0,1,12000003,149],[0,0,12000004,162],[0,1,12000004,167],[0,0,12000005,172],[0,1,12000005,175],[0,0,12000006,180],[0,1,12000006,183],[0,0,12000007,188],[0,1,12000007,191],[0,0,12000008,196],[0,1,12000008,199],[0,0,12000009,204],[0,1,12000009,211],[0,0,12000010,218],[0,1,12000010,219],[0,0,12000011,223],[0,1,12000011,228],[0,0,12000100,244],[0,1,12000100,245],[0,0,10000300,246],[0,5,4294967295,247],[0,0,10000200,255]],"blocks":[[[6,[[1,0],[1,11]]],[6,[[1,1],[1,12]]],[6,[[1,2],[1,34]]],[49,[[2,1000000]]],[50,[[4,1000005]]],[0,[[4,1000005],[0,0],[1,50],[0,1]]]],[[16,[[4,1000068],[1,0],[6,10000200],[7,10000200]]]],[[17,[[1,3000507],[1,2]]]],[[17,[[1,3000406],[1,0]]]],[[0,[[12,22],[0,1],[1,0],[0,5]]]],[[17,[[1,3030000],[1,0]]]],[[0,[[11,115],[0,0],[1,1],[0,7]]]],[[17,[[1,3000505],[1,5]]]],[[0,[[11,115],[0,0],[1,1],[0,9]]]],[[0,[[4,1000031],[0,0],[1,0],[0,10]]],[0,[[4,1000031],[0,1],[1,0],[0,11]]]],[[40,[[1,20018],[1,10000003]]],[16,[[4,1000070],[1,0],[6,10000003],[7,10000003]]],[39,[[1,20],[1,40],[4,1000031]]]],[[12,[[4,1000031],[1,1]]]],[[18,[[1,12000000]]],[21,[[1,12000000],[1,0]]],[1,[[4,1000001],[1,-1]]],[0,[[11,80],[0,0],[1,6],[0,13]]],[0,[[11,80],[0,0],[1,5],[0,14]]],[0,[[11,80],[0,0],[1,4],[0,17]]],[0,[[11,80],[0,0],[1,3],[0,18]]],[0,[[11,80],[0,0],[1,2],[0,21]]],[0,[[11,80],[0,0],[1,1],[0,22]]],[0,[[11,80],[0,0],[1,0],[0,25]]],[2,[[4,1000002],[1,-1],[0,0],[1,-1],[0,-1],[0,-1]]]],[[1,[[4,1000002],[2,1000052]]],[1,[[4,1000001],[1,900]]]],[[0,[[11,83],[0,1],[1,0],[0,15]]],[0,[[11,83],[0,0],[1,0],[0,16]]]],[[1,[[4,1000002],[2,1000048]]],[1,[[4,1000001],[1,800]]],[1,[[11,80],[1,6]]]],[[1,[[4,1000002],[2,1000047]]],[1,[[4,1000001],[1,700]]]],[[1,[[4,1000002],[2,1000033]]],[